{"reference":"Psalms 148","book":"Psalms","chapter":148,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"A Closing Sequence of Praise","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Psalm 148 belongs to Psalms 146–150, a closing sequence characterized as a crescendo of praise. Its repeated summons for all creation and all people to praise fits this larger movement toward the Psalter’s conclusion.","verse_refs":["Psalms 146:1-10","Psalms 147:1-20","Psalms 149:1-9","Psalms 150:1-6"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_psalms_148_214963197684ba692ed6d7c4"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}